{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00352",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 6.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Doctor, I've checked them in and done the preliminary measurements, I'll hand them over when you ask."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.26,
      "end_seconds": 10.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Okay, thanks. Hi, how can I help today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.11,
      "end_seconds": 23.66,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "Okay, so hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. Uh, it's been feeling dizzy when I stand, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.41,
      "end_seconds": 30.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "How long have you had it? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.62,
      "end_seconds": 37.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "For two days, I'd say. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.33,
      "end_seconds": 45.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.16,
      "end_seconds": 54.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say. Honestly, a few times a day. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.56,
      "end_seconds": 58.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.37,
      "end_seconds": 78.29,
      "duration_seconds": 18.92,
      "text": "Right, when it starts I tend to get dark urine as well. I've had diarrhoea too, for about two weeks. Well, as for diarrhoea, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. The dark urine? That's been for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.44,
      "end_seconds": 82.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.72,
      "end_seconds": 83.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.27,
      "end_seconds": 98.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let me check a few things. Any fainting, confusion or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.2,
      "end_seconds": 103.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I haven't had fainting, confusion or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.81,
      "end_seconds": 111.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Right, have you had any blood in the stool or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.24,
      "end_seconds": 118.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Okay, um, so no blood in the stool or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.42,
      "end_seconds": 120.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "What about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.11,
      "end_seconds": 123.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 125.09,
      "end_seconds": 129.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.61,
      "end_seconds": 135.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I mean, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.26,
      "end_seconds": 144.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.83,
      "end_seconds": 147.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.94,
      "end_seconds": 149.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.38,
      "end_seconds": 155.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Just a stent put in my heart, two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.31,
      "end_seconds": 171.05,
      "duration_seconds": 13.74,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.11,
      "end_seconds": 173.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.31,
      "end_seconds": 178.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.27,
      "end_seconds": 180.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.52,
      "end_seconds": 181.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.39,
      "end_seconds": 185.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.0,
      "end_seconds": 192.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.36,
      "end_seconds": 196.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Okay, so thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.25,
      "end_seconds": 200.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.83,
      "end_seconds": 205.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Ramipril. I take it 5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 206.45,
      "end_seconds": 214.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the ramipril was 10 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.32,
      "end_seconds": 219.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.0,
      "end_seconds": 224.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "No, I left it at home. ORS, whenever I remember."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.13,
      "end_seconds": 228.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.13,
      "end_seconds": 234.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Yes, diabetes. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.47,
      "end_seconds": 236.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.04,
      "end_seconds": 245.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.72,
      "end_seconds": 248.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 248.9,
      "end_seconds": 255.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Heart rate 107, blood pressure 100 over 58, saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.58,
      "end_seconds": 257.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.12,
      "end_seconds": 264.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.13,
      "end_seconds": 268.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Okay, stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.84,
      "end_seconds": 285.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Your mouth is quite dry and the skin is a little slow to spring back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.65,
      "end_seconds": 286.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.64,
      "end_seconds": 308.45,
      "duration_seconds": 18.81,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Putting it all together, my working impression is dehydration from a stomach bug. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out an electrolyte imbalance yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.66,
      "end_seconds": 319.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.94,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling dizzy when you stand for two days, severe, and no chest pain or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.81,
      "end_seconds": 322.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.74,
      "end_seconds": 326.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Okay, has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.35,
      "end_seconds": 345.76,
      "duration_seconds": 17.41,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.61,
      "end_seconds": 371.3,
      "duration_seconds": 24.69,
      "text": "Let's get blood salts, for dehydration. We should do a kidney function test for dehydration. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Small, frequent sips are better than a big glass at once, and keep going even if you don't feel thirsty. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.31,
      "end_seconds": 378.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.59,
      "end_seconds": 381.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Okay, um, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.87,
      "end_seconds": 392.3,
      "duration_seconds": 9.43,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you faint or can't keep any fluids down. I'd like to see you again next week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.77,
      "end_seconds": 393.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.03,
      "end_seconds": 398.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.75,
      "end_seconds": 404.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "So, I come back next week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.6,
      "end_seconds": 410.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.82,
      "end_seconds": 413.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Oh, no questions. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}